  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "把返出钻井液里的气体脱出来测浓度，就是气测。钻遇油气层时全烃会抬起来——但接单根、钻井液密度变化、后效气也会让它抬起来。解释的核心不是「看到峰」，而是「分清这是哪个峰」。这件事人工做的一致性很差，因为它要求同时看三样东西：峰形、组分比、以及它与钻时和泵况的时间关系。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "序列分段 + 分类", "desc": "先找异常段，再判流体性质" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "异常段 200—500 段", "desc": "真值只能靠试油验证" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "薄层不漏判", "desc": "薄油气层不再被背景气掩盖" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "中", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span>", "desc": "干扰因素多，标签成本高" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>气测的物理链条很短：返出钻井液 → 脱气器把溶解气搅出来 → 色谱测组分 → 记录仪画曲线。钻遇油气层时全烃明显抬升，这是发现油气最快的手段，也是最容易被误读的手段。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='气测地面流程与全烃曲线上的四种峰'><rect width='620' height='250' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='24' y='20' width='124' height='40' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='34' y='36' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>井口返出</text><text x='34' y='50' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>钻井液 + 气体</text><path d='M150 40h12' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M162 40l-4.4-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='168' y='20' width='124' height='40' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='178' y='36' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>脱气器</text><text x='178' y='50' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>搅拌脱气</text><path d='M294 40h12' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M306 40l-4.4-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='312' y='20' width='124' height='40' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#7e5a8d' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='322' y='36' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>色谱</text><text x='322' y='50' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>C1—C5 组分</text><path d='M438 40h12' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M450 40l-4.4-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='456' y='20' width='140' height='40' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='466' y='36' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>记录</text><text x='466' y='50' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>全烃 + 组分</text><line x1='34' y1='200' x2='602' y2='200' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><text x='34' y='80' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>全烃 %</text><polyline points='34,196 46,194 58,197 70,193 82,196 94,194 106,197 118,195 128,196 138,190 150,102 159,88 168,100 178,124 190,194 202,196 214,193 226,197 238,194 250,196 262,193 274,192 284,178 294,190 306,195 318,193 330,196 342,194 354,197 366,188 378,112 390,100 397,96 404,98 416,108 428,178 440,186 452,190 464,193 476,195 488,194 496,196 506,192 512,187 522,186 532,190 542,194 554,196 566,195 578,197 590,196 602,195' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><line x1='159' y1='84' x2='159' y2='200' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.55'/><line x1='284' y1='84' x2='284' y2='200' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.55'/><line x1='397' y1='84' x2='397' y2='200' stroke='#7e5a8d' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.55'/><line x1='522' y1='84' x2='522' y2='200' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.55'/><text x='159' y='76' font-size='8' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>油气层</text><text x='284' y='76' font-size='8' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>接单根气</text><text x='397' y='76' font-size='8' fill='#7e5a8d' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>后效气</text><text x='522' y='76' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>薄层</text><text x='602' y='216' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>井深 / 时间 →</text><text x='34' y='240' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>上面是地面设备链，下面是同期的全烃曲线。四种隆起长得像，成因完全不同</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　四种峰在曲线上几乎同形。<b>但它们的成因、宽度、与泵况的时间关系完全不同</b>——这才是可学的信号，而不是峰有多高。</p><p>麻烦在于解释依据不是「峰有多高」，而是「峰的形态 + 组分比例 + 与钻时的关系」。三样要放在一起看，人工一致性很差；更麻烦的是绝对阈值会随井深失效。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 190' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='同一个阈值在浅部与深部的不同表现'><rect width='620' height='190' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='4' y='18' width='294' height='140' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='16' y='34' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 浅部井段</text><line x1='16' y1='132' x2='290' y2='132' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='16' y1='86' x2='290' y2='86' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.1' stroke-dasharray='5 3' stroke-opacity='.75'/><text x='290' y='82' font-size='7.2' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='end'>固定阈值</text><polyline points='16,126 34,124 52,127 70,123 88,126 106,110 120,96 134,110 148,124 166,126 184,124 202,127 220,123 238,118 252,110 266,124 284,126' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='16' y='150' font-size='7.8' fill='#3f8560'>背景低 → 只有真显示越过阈值</text><rect x='312' y='18' width='304' height='140' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='324' y='34' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 深部井段（密度上调后）</text><line x1='324' y1='132' x2='608' y2='132' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='324' y1='86' x2='608' y2='86' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.1' stroke-dasharray='5 3' stroke-opacity='.75'/><polyline points='324,104 342,101 360,106 378,100 396,103 414,98 428,88 442,74 456,88 470,102 488,104 506,100 524,103 542,98 556,90 570,102 588,104 606,102' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='324' y='150' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>背景整体抬升 → 阈值一直越界，等于失效</text><text x='4' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>同一个绝对阈值，换个井段就废了。这是「固定阈值」路线最根本的问题，不是调参能解决的</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左边背景低，阈值还好使；右边钻井液密度一调，整条曲线抬起来，阈值就一直越界。<b>这不是阈值设得不好，是「绝对高度」这件事本身不是稳定信号</b>。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把解释拆成两步：先在曲线上找「值得解释的段」（分段），再对每段判流体性质（分类）。<b>两步分开，比端到端更容易验证</b>——分段错了，你能立刻看出来；端到端错了，你只能重训。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='气测解释的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · FIX</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>基线校正</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>扣密度影响</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>按排量算迟到</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · SEG</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>异常段检测</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>形态 + 局部对比</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>不用全局阈值</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · FEAT</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>段级特征</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>峰宽 / 对称性</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>与泵况时间关系</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · CLS</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>流体判别</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>油 / 气 / 水</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>组分比为主</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · CHECK</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>交叉验证</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>测井 / 试油</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>分歧归因</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>先分段再分类：段错了，后面的分类再准也没用</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第 2 步最容易被低估：<b>用全局阈值做分段，等于把「背景多高」这件事混进了判据</b>。改用「相对局部基线的突出程度」，才不受密度与排量影响。</p><p>第 3 步是领域知识真正进场的地方：接单根气<b>总落在停泵窗口里</b>，后效气<b>总是宽而缓</b>。这两条不是模型学出来的，是人告诉模型的。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>气测标签成本很高：一个层段到底是油是气，最终要靠试油。所以这个任务的数据准备，核心是<b>把「层段」这个单位对齐</b>，而不是堆样本量。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='气测相关数据的采样频次'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>SAMPLING · 从 30 秒到一个月</text><line x1='106' y1='22' x2='106' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='106' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1m</text><line x1='222' y1='22' x2='222' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='222' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>10m</text><line x1='339' y1='22' x2='339' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='339' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1h</text><line x1='429' y1='22' x2='429' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='429' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1d</text><line x1='526' y1='22' x2='526' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='526' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>30d</text><text x='98' y='38' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>色谱组分</text><line x1='190' y1='34' x2='236' y2='34' stroke='#7e5a8d' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='190' cy='34' r='2.4' fill='#7e5a8d'/><text x='534' y='38' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>30 s—2 min</text><text x='98' y='62' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>全烃</text><line x1='216' y1='58' x2='268' y2='58' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='216' cy='58' r='2.4' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='534' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1—5 min</text><text x='98' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>钻时 / 泵况</text><line x1='268' y1='82' x2='299' y2='82' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='268' cy='82' r='2.4' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='534' y='86' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>5—15 min</text><text x='98' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>测井解释</text><circle cx='429' cy='106' r='3' fill='#41699b'/><text x='534' y='110' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>单井一次</text><text x='98' y='134' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>试油结论</text><circle cx='558' cy='130' r='3' fill='#b05a51'/><text x='534' y='134' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' font-weight='600'>按月</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　前两行是特征，后三行是参照。注意<b>真正能当标签的「试油结论」只有按月一次</b>——这就是为什么多数项目先用测井解释做弱标签起步。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>气测全烃与组分</b>：1—5 m 一点，单井数千点，异常段解释 200—500 段<br>· <b>钻井液与工况参数</b>：密度、排量、钻时、泵况，用于校正<br>· <b>试油 / 生产验证</b>：层段与产能，真正的标签<br>· <b>录井描述</b>：荧光、岩屑含油，作为辅助证据</p><p><b>最容易漏的一条</b>　「泵况」看起来只是工程参数，其实是<b>剔干扰的主要依据</b>：接单根气一定落在停泵窗口里。没有它，只能靠幅度猜——而幅度恰好最不可靠。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>任务清晰、数据规整；难在干扰因素与标签成本。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>气测每口井都有</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>标签成本</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>真值靠试油</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>干扰因素</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>接单根 / 后效 / 密度</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>可解释性</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>需给组分依据</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>唯一 3 格是标签成本 → 所以要先做弱标签</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text><text x='418' y='118' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>推荐路线</text><text x='418' y='133' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>① 变点分段（规则为主）</text><text x='418' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>② 弱标签训练分类器</text><text x='418' y='159' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>③ 样本够了换试油真值</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　标签是最大瓶颈，其余都在可控范围。<b>所以技术选型应该反过来：先选「不需要大量标签」的分段方法，再补分类</b>，而不是一上来就端到端。</p><p><b>技术路线建议</b>　分段用变点检测或形态规则比深度网络更稳；分类用梯度提升就够——<b>样本量撑不起大模型，硬上只会得到一堆无法解释的权重</b>。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　序列分段 · 基线校正 · 弱标签学习 · 多源融合</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>这个案例最值钱的不是分类器，而是<b>那个把点变成段的分段步骤</b>。解释的单位错了，后面全错——而且错得很隐蔽，因为分类器在错误的段上依然能给出高置信度的答案。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 230' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='230' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>基线校正 + 分段 + 判别</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>三段式，每段都可单独验收：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① 扣密度与排量影响</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 以局部对比找段</text><text x='18' y='100' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>③ 段级特征 + 组分判别</text><rect x='18' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='47' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='47' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>校正</text><rect x='82' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='111' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='111' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>分段</text><rect x='146' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='175' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='175' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>判别</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>三个部件里，② 最不「AI」，但它</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>贡献了最大的收益。原因很简单：</text><text x='18' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>解释的单位是段，不是点。</text><text x='18' y='222' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>单位错了，后面再准也没用</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>四种峰长得太像</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>只按高度判，接单根气与后效气</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>都会被当成显示——它们确实</text><text x='224' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>一样高，甚至更高。</text><text x='224' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>只看峰值</text><rect x='232' y='101' width='112' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='352' y='110' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>58%</text><text x='224' y='138' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>峰形 + 组分</text><rect x='232' y='129' width='160' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='400' y='138' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>83%</text><text x='224' y='164' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>再加两条领域约束：接单根气落在</text><text x='224' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>停泵窗口内，后效气宽而缓。</text><text x='224' y='196' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>这两条不是学出来的，是问出来的。</text><text x='224' y='218' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>领域知识写进规则，比塞进损失函数可靠</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>用相对对比代替绝对高度</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>同一条曲线，两种判据：</text><rect x='430' y='68' width='172' height='34' rx='5' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='82' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>全烃 &gt; 12%</text><text x='440' y='95' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>→ 换个井段就失效</text><rect x='430' y='108' width='172' height='34' rx='5' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='122' font-size='8.2' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>高于局部基线 3.5σ</text><text x='440' y='135' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>→ 不受背景高度影响</text><text x='430' y='160' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>再加两条剔除规则：</text><rect x='430' y='168' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 174 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>峰顶落在停泵窗 → 剔除</text><rect x='430' y='188' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 194 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='198' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>半高宽 &gt; 20 点 → 剔除</text><text x='430' y='218' font-size='7.8' fill='#242b2e'>两条都是规则，没有一条是模型学的。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左：用了什么。中：为什么非它不可。右：它凭什么有用，以及<b>两条真正起作用的规则其实是领域知识，不是模型</b>。这个比例在工业场景里非常常见。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一个区块的气测解释复核",
      "lead": [
        "目标：把**薄油气层（厚度小于 2 m）的漏判率**从 30% 降到 10% 以下，同时不显著增加误判。",
        "薄层是最实际的痛点：它不是不存在，是被背景气盖住了。而误判增加会让解释员直接关掉提示。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["井数", "14"],
        ["解释段", "386"],
        ["薄层漏判", "30% → 10%"],
        ["试油验证", "42 段"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "迟到时间与基线校正",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "先按排量算迟到时间，再扣掉钻井液密度变化带来的基线漂移。",
          "effect": "让曲线只反映地层",
          "trap": "不校正，密度一变整条曲线就整体抬高——**而抬高之后，所有绝对阈值同时失效**"
        },
        {
          "name": "异常段检测",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "用形态特征（上升沿、平台、衰减）加局部对比找段，而不是逐点判全局阈值。",
          "effect": "给出段而不是点，且不受背景高度影响",
          "trap": "逐点判阈值，一个峰会被切成几十个碎片；用全局阈值，深部井段会整段越界"
        },
        {
          "name": "段级特征与干扰剔除",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "对每段算半高宽、对称性、峰顶是否落在停泵窗，按规则剔除接单根气与后效气。",
          "effect": "把四种峰压到只剩真显示",
          "trap": "只按幅度剔除，会把正常的小幅薄层一起剔掉——**薄层恰恰是幅度最小的真显示**"
        },
        {
          "name": "组分特征与流体判别",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "算 C1/C2、湿度系数、平衡比，对保留下来的段做油 / 气 / 水三分类。",
          "effect": "把峰翻译成流体性质",
          "trap": "只看全烃峰值，油和气分不开；绝对浓度受钻井液影响大，**组分比才是稳定判据**"
        },
        {
          "name": "交叉验证与回流",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "与测井解释、试油结论逐段比对，分歧段归因后回流，薄层单独加权。",
          "effect": "让模型知道自己在哪类层上会错",
          "trap": "只看总体一致率，会掩盖薄层的系统性漏判——**而那正是这个项目唯一的目标**"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点：每一步产出什么、验收什么",
        "html": "<p>下面五张图对应上面五步。<b>第 3 步是这个案例真正的胜负手</b>：它包含两条不属于模型、但决定成败的领域规则。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第一步 迟到与基线校正'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 01 · 迟到与基线校正 · 扣掉不是地层造成的那部分</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='296' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 未校正</text><line x1='12' y1='88' x2='284' y2='88' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='12,86 36,84 60,88 84,84 108,86 132,80 156,62 180,44 204,38 228,44 252,50 276,52' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><rect x='150' y='22' width='80' height='66' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.08'/><text x='190' y='100' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>密度下调造成的假抬升</text><rect x='312' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='324' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 已校正</text><line x1='324' y1='88' x2='596' y2='88' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='324,86 348,84 372,88 396,84 420,86 444,84 468,86 492,83 516,86 540,84 564,87 588,85' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='324' y='100' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51'>只剩地层信号</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：同一层段在不同密度下，校正后的曲线形态一致</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第二步 局部对比分段'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 02 · 局部对比分段 · 不受背景高度影响</text><line x1='20' y1='92' x2='600' y2='92' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><polyline points='20,78 60,76 100,80 140,74 180,76 210,58 240,30 270,54 300,74 340,76 380,72 420,74 460,60 480,48 500,62 530,74 560,76 590,78' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M20 78 C 100 80 160 74 210 70 C 340 60 420 62 590 72' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3' stroke-opacity='.7'/><rect x='228' y='26' width='24' height='66' rx='2' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.1'/><rect x='474' y='44' width='14' height='48' rx='2' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.1'/><text x='240' y='22' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>段 1</text><text x='481' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>段 2</text><text x='20' y='112' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>虚线是局部基线。判据是「高出基线多少倍」，不是「绝对值多少」</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第三步 干扰剔除规则'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 03 · 干扰剔除 · 两条规则，都不是模型学的</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='296' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 峰顶落在停泵窗</text><rect x='12' y='48' width='58' height='48' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.14'/><polyline points='12,88 24,86 36,86 44,70 52,56 60,70 70,86 96,88 120,86 144,84' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-linejoin='round'/><text x='41' y='106' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle'>停泵窗</text><rect x='140' y='52' width='142' height='30' rx='5' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='150' y='64' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51'>窄而尖 + 落在停泵窗</text><text x='150' y='76' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51'>→ 接单根气，剔除</text><rect x='312' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='324' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 峰很宽，衰减很长</text><path d='M324 88 C 348 86 372 60 396 46 C 430 34 500 44 596 66' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='396' y1='46' x2='396' y2='56' stroke='#7e5a8d' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='366' y='104' font-size='7.4' fill='#7e5a8d' text-anchor='middle'>半高宽 &gt; 20 点</text><text x='452' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#7e5a8d'>→ 后效气，剔除</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>两条规则都可以写成 if-else，且解释员一秒钟就能复核</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第四步 组分比判别流体'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 04 · 组分判别 · 用比值，不用绝对值</text><rect x='20' y='24' width='240' height='80' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='150' y='24' width='110' height='50' fill='#e6f1ec' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='20' y='74' width='130' height='30' fill='#e7eef9' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='150' y='74' width='110' height='30' fill='#f8ecdf' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='205' y='42' font-size='8' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>气层</text><text x='85' y='92' font-size='8' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>水层</text><text x='205' y='92' font-size='8' fill='#8e5229' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>油层</text><circle cx='70' cy='86' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='100' cy='82' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='176' cy='86' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='216' cy='80' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='186' cy='56' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='224' cy='46' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.6'/><text x='140' y='114' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>湿度系数 →</text><text x='6' y='46' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>C1/C2</text><rect x='288' y='24' width='332' height='80' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='300' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>为什么用比值</text><text x='300' y='58' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>绝对浓度随钻井液密度、排量、脱气效率变化</text><text x='300' y='72' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>组分之间的比例则相对稳定</text><text x='300' y='92' font-size='8.2' fill='#242b2e'>验收：三分类准确率，且水层不被判成气层</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第五步 交叉验证与回流'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 05 · 交叉验证 · 分歧要归类，不要只计数</text><rect x='0' y='24' width='192' height='82' rx='7' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>气测解释</text><text x='12' y='60' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>段边界 + 流体性质</text><text x='12' y='78' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>带回溯依据</text><text x='12' y='96' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>386 段</text><rect x='214' y='24' width='192' height='82' rx='7' fill='#e7eef9' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='226' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>测井 / 试油</text><text x='226' y='60' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>独立参照</text><text x='226' y='78' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>42 段有试油真值</text><text x='226' y='96' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>其余用测井解释</text><rect x='428' y='24' width='192' height='82' rx='7' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>分歧段</text><text x='440' y='60' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>按类型归类：漏判 / 误判 /</text><text x='440' y='74' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>流体判错</text><text x='440' y='96' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51'>薄层单独统计并加权回流</text><path d='M192 65h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M212 65l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M406 65h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M426 65l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：每一段分歧都能说出「为什么」——分歧是标注线索，不是失败</text></svg><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算「解释得准」</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>段级召回</td><td>真实显示段中被识别的比例</td><td>0.91</td></tr><tr><td>薄层召回</td><td>厚度小于 2 m 的显示段召回</td><td>0.88</td></tr><tr><td>段级精确率</td><td>识别出的段中真实的比例</td><td>0.79</td></tr><tr><td>流体判别准确率</td><td>油气水三分类准确率</td><td>0.83</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>主指标是<b>按段</b>的召回与精确率，<b>薄层必须单独统计</b>——它只有 0.88，比整体低，但比改造前的 0.70 好得多。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        { "name": "把接单根气当显示", "why": "接单根时气体集中返出形成尖峰，幅度甚至高于真显示。解决方向：与泵况记录联动，峰顶落在停泵窗内的直接剔除。" },
        { "name": "基线漂移未扣除", "why": "密度调整会让全烃整体抬高，绝对阈值同时失效。解决方向：用密度与排量做回归校正，或改用相对局部基线的判据。" },
        { "name": "薄层被平滑掉", "why": "为抑制噪声做了强平滑，几十厘米的薄层直接消失。解决方向：分段用形态而不是幅度，并单独为薄层做加窗分析。" }
      ]
    },

    "demo": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "html": "demo/index.html",
      "label": "可运行示范",
      "intro": "一条全烃曲线，四种峰。红色虚线是现场常用的固定阈值，绿色是我们做的分段判据。拖「干扰强度」让接单根与后效气变大，看固定阈值怎么把它们全判成显示；再拖「薄层幅度」，看薄层在哪个位置被背景吃掉。",
      "height": 660
    }
  }
}
